*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0034
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-08-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 442
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0034.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 AT-CD              PIC X.
       88 AT-GOLD-OR-PREMIUM VALUES 'G' 'P'.
    *> AVERAGE MONTHLY BALANCE
    05 M-BL               PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 WS-FWV             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 FWV-WAIVED VALUE 'Y'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 WS-MFEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM WAIVE-FEE
    DISPLAY "WS-FWV=" WS-FWV
    DISPLAY "WS-MFEE=" WS-MFEE
    STOP RUN.
WAIVE-FEE.
    IF AT-GOLD-OR-PREMIUM OR M-BL >= 1500
        SET FWV-WAIVED TO TRUE
        MOVE 0 TO WS-MFEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 10 TO WS-MFEE
    END-IF.
